Package: com.striker91n.walink
Name: Walink
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: Applications
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0)
Maintainer: striker91n
Author: striker91n
Description: Unofficial WhatsApp client for jailbroken iOS 12
 An embedded Node.js runtime runs Baileys on-device and the native UI drives it over loopback HTTP.
